  "meta": {
    "space": "embeddings_cardbert.npy",
    "space_digest": "1c7fb3995420711c",
    "projection": "classical MDS + SMACOF, canonically oriented",
    "clustering": "average-linkage agglomerative on cosine distance, 2 levels",
    "cards": 97,
    "unresolved": [],
    "note": "Positions are LOCAL to this deck and are not atlas positions — the deck is re-laid-out from its own cards, which is the whole point. Anything that draws this must say so.",
    "named_by": "deck-cartographer",
    "cartographer_notes": [
      "city-0 is 27 cards, the deck's mass, and holds 5 of the deck's verified-line cards (Ancient Gold Dragon, Drakuseth, Lathliss, Miirym, Terror of the Peaks); with Dragon Tempest and Sneak Attack (city-1) and Panharmonicon (city-5) that is the engine on the record.",
      "city-0-hood-0 reads half-arbitrary: Dragonlord's Servant, Dragonspeaker Shaman and Whirlwing Stormbrood enable Dragon casting (discount, flash grant), but Glorybringer (exert removal) and Twinflame Tyrant (damage doubler) do a different job; CardBERT likely grouped them on shared 'Dragon spells / Dragon' wording. Named for the three that fit.",
      "city-0-hood-1 is ten legendary Dragons plus Goldspan; six of eleven make treasure. The split from hood-3 looks thematic (legendary vs not) more than functional.",
      "city-5 and city-6 each have a single neighbourhood identical to the city; both left unnamed so they fall back, since a narrower name is impossible.",
      "city-2-hood-1 puts Desolation of Smaug (a sorcery: sweeper plus four Dragon-only mana) beside two red-white lands; it belongs in the mana city on its ritual half but is the odd member of that hood.",
      "city-3-hood-1 is all black-red producers (Blood Crypt, Dragonskull Summit, Smoldering Marsh); the split from hood-0 is by colour pair, which reads clean. Dragonskull Summit has no basic type, so the city name FETCH TARGETS is true for 14 of 15.",
      "city-1-hood-0 includes Chaos Warp, which is removal, not a tutor; CardBERT grouped it on library-reveal wording. Membership left as measured."
    ]
  },
